      "message": "build(xtask): cargo xtask package is the one Windows zip layout\n\nThe portable tree and zip were staged twice: inline PowerShell in\nrelease.yml's Windows job and xtask's release_pack (cargo xtask release).\n`cargo xtask package [--version X.Y.Z] [--out dist] [--bin-dir <dir>]\n[--dry-run]` now stages and zips, nothing else; the release cut's zip\nphase and release.yml both call it. Without --version it reads post.exe\n--version (the workflow's old single truth); under Actions it writes\nversion/stage/zip to $GITHUB_OUTPUT and CAMCRAFT_VERSION to $GITHUB_ENV,\nand the installer step takes the reported stage. A real run off Windows\nis refused by name; --dry-run lists the tree anywhere.\n\nci.yml / nightly.yml call cargo xtask gate batch|release directly (still\nworkflow_dispatch only). scripts/README.md's gate section is rewritten\naround cargo xtask gate, CI wording corrected, package documented. The\nprocess-file lists (AGENTS.md fork sync, review-prs 2d) add release.ps1\nand collect-decisions.ps1/.sh; PROCESS_VERSION 8 -> 9.\n\nFixes #752\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
